  "section": "10.9",
  "rulesText": "An item in the Wand category is typically 12 to 15 inches long and crafted of metal, bone, or wood. It is tipped with metal, crystal, stone, or some other material.\n\nUnless its description notes otherwise, a wand can be used as an Arcane Focus."
}
